    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Look.</strong> Elspeth Ravenmoor, Silas&#39;s first wife, drowned in the manor pond on All Hallows&#39; Eve thirty years ago. Pale woman, grey gown, veil, lantern of green glass. Never speaks; only bows her head.</p><p><strong>Appears.</strong> Exactly twice: rising from her tomb in round 4 of the showdown (or when Quill drops below half HP), and standing on the pond at dawn in the epilogue. Afterward her lantern waits on her memorial stone; it works as a Lantern of Revealing.</p>",
        "public": ""
